      <div class="card">
        <h3>Is registering my CV the same as applying for a job?</h3>
        <p>No — registering simply adds you to our talent network so consultants can match you to suitable roles as they arise. You choose whether to proceed with any opportunity we put forward.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Will my current employer know I'm looking?</h3>
        <p>Never. We treat every registration as confidential and will not approach your current employer or share your details without your explicit permission.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Do you only work with experienced candidates?</h3>
        <p>We recruit across all levels, from apprentices and graduates through to senior leadership — our sector consultants will tell you honestly where you fit the market.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>How quickly will I hear back?</h3>
        <p>We aim to review every registration within two working days, and will always let you know the outcome — even if it's not progressing right now.</p>
      </div>
